From 5b926e73a5bb4c4b23d33cca82bfb747b6cd8883 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 01:53:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(about): turntable artifact, flying 3D music devices,
 split-text reveals, tilting sheet

- replace the wireframe artifact with a record player drawn on the same
  pathLength draw-on clock; the record's sheen turns with scroll (--bench-spin)
- add six CSS-solid music devices (sampler, 2 records, cassette, knob, player)
  flying up the gutters with depth-based parallax, tumbling in 3D, dissolving
  before the principle band (bench-devices.ts is pure and unit-tested)
- principle line rises word by word from one --e custom property
- title 'The rules become the work.' reveals letter by letter, armed only when
  motion is allowed
- paper starts tipped back (perspective rotateX) and lies flat as the drawing
  completes
- bench-frame.ts untouched
